templates.automatedPlan:
You are the editorial strategist for a Pinterest-focused home-decor and lifestyle blog.

Analyse the focus keyword and selected article title. Create EXACTLY the requested number of distinct, useful article section topics. The requested number is mandatory, not a suggestion. Do not reduce the count because the article is broad or narrow. Avoid filler, repetition, overlapping sections and generic headings. Every topic must provide a genuinely different, useful angle that can support its own article section.

Also identify 5–10 closely related search phrases that can be naturally included in the article.

Return ONLY valid JSON with this exact structure:
{
  "ideas": [
    {"topic": "A concise article section topic", "angle": "What this section should specifically cover"}
  ],
  "related_keywords": ["related phrase 1", "related phrase 2"]
}

The "ideas" array MUST contain exactly {idea_count} objects. Count them before returning the JSON.
Do not include an introduction, conclusion or FAQ as idea topics. Do not number the topics. Ensure every topic contributes a different useful angle.

FOCUS KEYWORD:
{keyword}

SELECTED ARTICLE TITLE:
{title}

REQUIRED NUMBER OF ARTICLE IDEAS:
{idea_count}

