{keyword}

ARTICLE TITLE:
{title}

TOPIC TO DEVELOP:
{topic}

SPECIFIC ANGLE:
{angle}

PREVIOUS IDEAS TO AVOID REPEATING:
{previous_ideas}

templates.automatedPlanRepair:
